+/* hero-exit-scroll-timeline h1 (de-hero hero.md §2D R1): once JS has armed the section (data-fw-reveal,
+   FRreveal in 2.DyWL8TcE.js; the card is `inert` while hidden: not focusable, out of the a11y tree), the
+   hidden card stays visibility: visible at opacity 0, so it is laid out and rastered before the 0.72 flip,
+   and the flip toggles no inherited property. Same transitions as above minus visibility. The reveal
+   blur ends at blur(0px) (a list matching blur(14px)); data-fw-revealed (~1 s later) drops it to none. */
+.start-selling-future[data-fw-reveal]:not(.is-visible) > .start-selling-future-card {
